# Reviewer selection for AGENTS.md rule 11: one independent reviewer session
# double-checks every agent-made commit and merge, including WIP checkpoints.
#
# Copy this file to config/reviewer.local (gitignored).
# Owner policy: DeepSeek 4.1 Flash-Max only; no second model is required.
# If unavailable, ask the owner before substituting. Never use Sol to review.
#
REVIEWER_AGENT=general
REVIEWER_MODEL=opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash#max
